WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.563 --> 00:00:02.059
- We bought that for the Nick.

00:00:02.059 --> 00:00:03.720
‘Cause we thought the Nick could use them,

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:08.026
but we didn't realize that,
they were sorta ugly way of it.

00:00:08.026 --> 00:00:09.986
- [Man] She is not an attractive -

00:00:09.986 --> 00:00:10.823
- [Man] She's unattractive.

00:00:10.823 --> 00:00:14.406
- [Man] Yeah.
- [Man] Which is unfortunate.

00:00:16.099 --> 00:00:18.455
- John Koch here, John Koch Antiques.

00:00:18.455 --> 00:00:19.336
- I'm Kevin Crayton.

00:00:19.336 --> 00:00:22.599
I'm the manager of John Koch Antiques.

00:00:22.599 --> 00:00:23.799
- [John] We're an antique shop

00:00:23.799 --> 00:00:25.598
on the Upper West Side of Manhattan.

00:00:25.598 --> 00:00:30.360
- [Kevin] And we specialize
in the sets for TV and movies.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:32.301
We buy estates for the most part,

00:00:32.301 --> 00:00:35.375
so we get people's whole lives.

00:00:35.375 --> 00:00:37.382
- We would sort of spill
them out on the floor

00:00:37.382 --> 00:00:40.156
and other dealers would come, and with them

00:00:40.156 --> 00:00:43.205
came the set decorators
and production designers

00:00:43.205 --> 00:00:45.940
that did the television shows and movies.

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:49.132
The first of which was
probably Woody Allen.

00:00:49.132 --> 00:00:49.965
- Sex and the City.

00:00:49.965 --> 00:00:50.798
- The Nick.

00:00:50.798 --> 00:00:51.631
- The Blacklist.

00:00:51.631 --> 00:00:52.464
- Vinyl.
- The Good Wife.

00:00:52.464 --> 00:00:53.297
- Mad Men.

00:00:53.297 --> 00:00:54.794
- Gotham.
- Wolf of Wall Street.

00:00:54.794 --> 00:00:55.627
- Ugly Betty.

00:00:55.627 --> 00:00:56.460
Madame Secretary.

00:00:56.460 --> 00:00:57.666
Deuce with James Franco.

00:00:57.666 --> 00:00:59.720
Saturday Night Live.

00:00:59.720 --> 00:01:01.820
I think we've done almost every -

00:01:01.820 --> 00:01:03.236
- The Ice Storm.
- Admissions.

00:01:03.236 --> 00:01:04.318
- Girl on a Train.
- Gossip Girl.

00:01:04.318 --> 00:01:05.360
- Igby Goes Down.

00:01:05.360 --> 00:01:09.089
- Other than that it's just
the people that come in.

00:01:09.089 --> 00:01:12.112
That you're really surprised
at, like Louis C.K.

00:01:12.112 --> 00:01:14.853
And he actually asked to
use the store's location

00:01:14.853 --> 00:01:16.995
for his season finale last year.

00:01:16.995 --> 00:01:18.611
And then the producer
came over to me and said,

00:01:18.611 --> 00:01:20.072
“Louis wants to know if you'll, like,

00:01:20.072 --> 00:01:21.620
do him a favor and be in the show.”

00:01:21.620 --> 00:01:23.256
- I want to get that for her.

00:01:23.256 --> 00:01:24.089
- Okay.

00:01:24.089 --> 00:01:25.172
- How much, how much is it?

00:01:25.172 --> 00:01:26.005
- 495.

00:01:28.507 --> 00:01:30.231
- Okay, I don't want to get it.

00:01:30.231 --> 00:01:33.274
- Working on Louis C.K.
show is just like an honor.

00:01:33.274 --> 00:01:36.341
You know, I would do it for
free, you have to cut that.

00:01:36.341 --> 00:01:38.028
(laughing)

00:01:38.028 --> 00:01:40.528
(light music)

